Subject: [PATCH 2/5] drm/msm: sm8750: add Adreno 830 catalog, DSC fixes, and QTB500 sync

- Add Adreno 830 (0x44050000) register catalog in a6xx_catalog.c
- Use RGB888 CMD DST format for RGB101010+DSC and program
  STREAM0_SLICE_WIDTH = bytes_per_pkt in dsi_host.c
- Read SM8750 mdp_hf_qtb (0x017d0000) on MDSS enable to prevent DSI
  command-mode DMA wedge after warm reset
---
